	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06_oldman1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ろうじん『コバルオン　ビリジオン
そして　テラキオンの　３びきは▼
ひとが　はじめた　いくさから
なかまを　まもるため　ひとびとに▽
たたかいを　いどんだ　という……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>老人『コバルオン　ビリジオン
そして　テラキオンの　３びきは▼
人が　はじめた　戦から
仲間を　守るため　人々に▽
戦いを　挑んだ　という……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06_oldman1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとが　たたかいを　やめなければ
ポケモンたちの　へいわも　ない▼
ひとの　おこないに　よって
おおくの　いのちが　うしなわれると▽
かれらは　わかっていたのじゃな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人が　争いを　やめなければ
ポケモンたちの　平和も　ない▼
人の　行いに　よって
多くの　命が　失われると▽
彼らは　わかっていたのじゃな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:29:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:29:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06_oldman1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……しかし　なぜ
ひとの　まえに　すがたを？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……しかし　なぜ
人の　前に　姿を？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:31:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
